{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは、私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/10/31/1940877/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前:渡辺みり愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年齢:17"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな事:洋服屋さん巡り、洋楽を聴く、歩く事"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボーッとする事、寝る事"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな色:白、黒、黄、赤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日11月1日、17歳になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっと17歳、まだ17歳。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46には13歳の時に入りました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂には入って4回目のBirthday。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難いことです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかあっという間で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日が無我夢中の日々でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17歳はどんな年になるのかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/10/31/1940877/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様からの応援は、私にとっての力の源です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「華のセブンティーン」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この言葉、ずっと言いたくてうずうず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"してました( ・∇・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/10/31/1940877/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも宜しくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/10/31/1940877/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「みり愛って猫みたいな性格だよね」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言われたことがあります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(いや何度か言われる)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またみてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渡辺みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}